        "### 1.4 - TikToken\n",
        "\n",
        "`tiktoken` is a production-ready library which offers high‑speed tokenization used by OpenAI models.  \n",
        "Let's compare the older **gpt2** encoding with the newer **cl100k_base** used in GPT‑4."
