        "  * `x` – input vector  \n",
        "  * `W` – weight matrix (learned)  \n",
        "  * `b` – bias vector (learned)\n",
        "\n",
        "Although this looks basic, chaining thousands of such linear transforms (with nonlinearities in between) gives neural nets their expressive power.\n"
